title    Showdown at Dry Creek
composer Swiss Music Box (original)
about    A whistle hangs in the stillness before sundown. tempo    80
beats    4
steps    2
swing    0
reverb   0.3

voice whistle flute vol=0.74 pan=-0.18 rev=0.36 gate=0.92
voice twang guitar vol=0.38 pan=0.16 rev=0.22 gate=0.78
voice roll piano vol=0.56 pan=0.04 rev=0.26 gate=0.9
voice toll bell vol=0.24 pan=0.3 rev=0.42

pattern intro
whistle | A5------- | .--- E5--- | G5------- | .--- D5--- |
twang   | D3- .- A3- .- | D3- .- A3- .- | G3- .- D4- .- | A2- .- E3- .- |
roll    | D2------- | _ | G2------- | A2------- |
toll    | D5------- | _ | _ | A4------- |

pattern A
whistle | A5------- | .--- G5--- | E5------- | D5------- |
twang   | D3--- .--- | D3- .- A3- .- | G3--- .--- | A2- .- E3- .- |
roll    | D2------- | _ | G2------- | A2------- |
toll    | D5------- | _ | G5------- | A4------- |

pattern B
whistle | .--- A5--- | C6------- | B5--- G5--- | A5------- |
twang   | D3- .- A3- .- | D3- .- A3- .- | G3- .- D4- .- | A2- .- E3- .- |
roll    | D2--- A2--- | D3------- | G2--- D3--- | A2------- |
toll    | _ | D5------- | _ | A4------- |

pattern A2 from A
whistle | A5------- | E5--- G5--- | F#5------- | D5------- |
roll    | D2--- A2--- | _ | G2--- D3--- | D2------- |
toll    | D5------- | _ | G5------- | D5------- |

play intro
loop A*2 B*2 A2*2
